    "disown": {
      "word": "DISOWN",
      "definitions": [
        {
          "text": "To refuse to own or acknowledge as belonging to one's self; to disavow or deny, as connected with one's self personally; as, a parent can hardly disown his child; an author will sometimes disown his writings.",
